    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Starryard, an adrenaline-packed space flight shooter. In this game, you will play the role of a pilot of a spaceship, maneuvering the spaceship to shuttle between the stars, and at the same time need to defeat the enemy in fierce battles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse the mouse to control the direction in the game, the left button can launch a machine gun attack, and the right button can launch a tracking missile for long-range attack. In addition, you can also use the space bar to accelerate, the QE key to rotate, and the WASD key to control the direction of the spaceship.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring the game, you'll encounter a variety of enemies, including other spaceships, space stations, and more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStart your Starryard journey now, explore the unknown areas of the universe, defeat enemies, and become the overlord of the universe!",
